# Supabase project credentials for Finora cloud sync.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your project's values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored by Vite defaults.
#
# These names are intentionally NOT prefixed with `VITE_` (so the
# Vite-default prefix doesn't leak project naming conventions).
# They're exposed to client code via an explicit allow-list in
# vite.config.ts (the `define` block).

BASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
BASE_ANON_KEY=<your-anon-key>
